[00:00.00] 作曲 : De Backer
[00:00.00][by:itslili_notlily]
[01:31.12]I'm living with your memory
[01:31.12]我带着你的记忆存活
[01:35.21]In the attic in my mind
[01:35.21]独居在我幻想中的小阁楼里
[01:39.60]And you've been getting by without me
[01:39.60]你如今没有我也能过活
[01:42.58]But I've been spending all my time
[01:42.58]但我还紧抓着时间不放
[01:48.74]With a girl that I remember
[01:48.74]和我记忆中的女孩
[01:53.00]Who'll never leave or need to grow
[01:53.00]她永远不会离开也不需要长大
[01:57.52]Cos when you left you left your memory
[01:57.52]因为你离开时只留下了你的记忆
[02:00.59]Now it's the only thing I know
[02:00.59]如今这是我唯一知道的了
[02:24.57]When the past gives me no comfort
[02:24.57]当过去再也不能给我安慰时
[02:29.01]And though the future is the cost
[02:29.01]虽然代价是付出未来
[02:33.37]The way I'm choosing to remember
[02:33.37]我选择以这种方式铭记
[02:36.43]I'll forever be the man I never was
[02:36.43]我将永远是我从未成为的人
[02:41.61]And you, you fade
[02:41.61]你在慢慢消逝
[02:49.89]But the memory remains the same
[02:49.89]可记忆还是一成不变
[02:59.46]And I, I can't change
[02:59.46]我无力改变
[03:07.86]And I think that living with your memory
[03:07.86]这样带着有你的记忆生活
[03:12.65]Is slowly driving me insane
[03:12.65]我想这正在慢慢让我发疯
[05:07.31]You are perfect but you're empty
[05:07.31]你完美又虚无缥缈
[05:11.56]And it gets so lonely in my mind
[05:11.56]这样的幻像在我心里如此无助
[05:16.25]Cos your image in my memory's
[05:16.25]因为你在我脑海里的影像
[05:19.03]The only shred of you that's left behind
[05:19.03]只剩你的些许被遗弃的碎片了
[05:25.21]You were real but then you left me
[05:25.21]你曾是如此真实 但后来你离开了
[05:29.61]And that's the part I can't accept
[05:29.61]我不能释怀
[05:33.67]So I'll keep on living with your memory
[05:33.67]所以我带着有你的记忆继续活着
[05:37.48]Because it's all that I've got left
[05:37.48]只因为 这就是我仅有的了
[05:41.57]It's all that I've got left
[05:41.57]这就是我的一切了
